  <message name="IDS_OOBE_DRIVE_PINNING_SUBTITLE" desc="Description of the drive pinning screen.">
    Your files in My Drive will sync to your Chromebook automatically so you can access them without an internet connection. You can change this anytime in Settings > Files.
